      "comment": "COLDFRONT (4) is a two-year-old colt from the Rickie Alchin yard on debut. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Trial winner who looks above average. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to his career. LOCHINVAR JAZZ (8) is back from a break of three-and-a-half months and looks to be right up to the mark following a placing in a recent trial. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Likely to run a big race to kick off this campaign. FEROCIOUS LOVER (10) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 1609m at Menangle. SAN LUCA (11) is worth some thought despite his last-start sixth over 1609m at Menangle on September 22.",
